    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d724">

                <pb facs="0975" n="861" sameAs="frus:frus1931v01/pg861"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.632/101: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Austria</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Stockton</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Vienna</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-03-30T10:00:00+01:00">March 30, 1931—10
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received March 30—7:14 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>24. Your 13, March 28, 2 p.m.<anchor n="16" xml:id="d724-f1"/> Austrian President
                    will ratify supplemental article and reservation next week. Urge American
                    instrument be sent me immediately as Austrian Government will be prepared to
                    effect exchange as soon as it reaches me.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stockton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
